8275e/2002/CVE-2002-1079.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1079.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0535.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0534","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0534.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1077","title":"IPSwitch IMail Web Calendaring 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IPSwitch IMail 的 Web Calendaring 服务（iwebcal）在处理 HTTP POST 请求时存在不完整请求处理缺陷，当攻击者发送一个缺少 Content-Length 字段的 HTTP POST 请求时，服务无法正确解析请求边界，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 IPSwitch IMail 6.x 及 7.0.x 版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。目前厂商已发布更新版本修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1077"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:41Z","remediation":"升级 IPSwitch IMail 至 7.2 或更高版本（该版本已修复 iwebcal 服务对畸形 HTTP POST 请求的处理逻辑）。如无法升级，可在防火墙或主机层面限制对 TCP 8484 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接；若业务不需要 Web 日历功能，可直接禁用 iwebcal 服务以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0399.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9722.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5365","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21673","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3eae031b5df6a3c6a1cc304f5e054cd002eb1bd6/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1077.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1077","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1077.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1077.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2002/CVE-2002-1077.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1077.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1077.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1077.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1077.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1077.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0534.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0533","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0533.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1076","title":"IPSwitch IMail Web Messaging 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IPSwitch IMail 的 Web Messaging 守护进程存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标发送超长的 HTTP GET 请求（HTTP/1.0）触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 IPSwitch IMail 7.12 之前的所有版本（包括 6.x、7.0、7.1 等），CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1076"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:40Z","remediation":"立即升级 IPSwitch IMail 至 7.12 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Web Messaging 守护进程中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙或反向代理层面限制对 Web Messaging 服务端口（通常为 8383）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并监控异常长度的 HTTP GET 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0326.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0363.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0368.html","http://support.ipswitch.com/kb/IM-20020729-DM01.htm","http://support.ipswitch.com/kb/IM-20020731-DM02.htm","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9679.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5323","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21654","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2002/CVE-2002-1076.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1076.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1076","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1076.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1076.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1076.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2002/CVE-2002-1076.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1076.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1076.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1076.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0533.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0533.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0533.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0532","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0532.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1075","title":"Pegasus Mail 消息头缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Pegasus Mail 4.01 及更早版本在处理邮件消息头（To 和 From 字段）时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送包含超长邮件头部的恶意邮件，触发缓冲区溢出，导致邮件客户端崩溃（拒绝服务），在特定条件下可进一步实现任意代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户在 Pegasus Mail 中打开或预览恶意邮件即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1075"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:40Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pegasus Mail 至 4.02 或更高版本，该版本已修复邮件头缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，建议更换为其他受支持的邮件客户端（如 Thunderbird），并配置邮件网关过滤超长 To/From 头字段（超过 259 字符）的邮件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0277.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9673.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5302","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21648","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1075.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1075.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1075","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1075.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1075.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1075.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bd9fe5c6ad63a26e0384af877431750bd67b40cc/2002/CVE-2002-1075.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1075.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1075.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1075.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0532.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0531","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0531.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1073","title":"MERCUR MailServer Control-Service 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"MERCUR MailServer 的 Control-Service 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向该服务发送超长密码字符串触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 MERCUR MailServer 3.3/4.0/4.2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1073"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:40Z","remediation":"立即将 MERCUR MailServer 升级至 4.2.0.0 以上版本（如 4.3 或更高），或迁移至仍在维护的邮件服务器软件。如无法升级，在防火墙层面将控制服务端口（TCP 32000）限制为仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问，并禁用不必要的远程管理功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0195.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9618.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5261","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21626","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1073.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1073.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1073","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1073.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1073.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2002/CVE-2002-1073.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1073.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1073.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1073.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1073.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0531.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0530","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0530.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1072","title":"ZyXEL Prestige 642R/310 ICMP 畸形数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ZyXEL Prestige 642R 和 Prestige 310 路由器存在 ICMP 畸形数据包拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标设备发送特制的超大分片 \"jolt\" 风格 ICMP 数据包，触发设备协议栈处理异常，导致路由器崩溃或重启，无法正常提供网络服务。该漏洞影响 Prestige 642R 2.50(FA.1) 及 Prestige 310 V3.25(M.01) 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。厂商已发布固件更新修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1072"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:40Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 ZyXEL Prestige 642R 2.50(FA.1) 及 Prestige 310 V3.25(M.01) 路由器，上述产品已停产且厂商不再提供安全更新。建议立即将受影响设备替换为受支持的型号。如无法立即替换，可在网络边界防火墙上配置 ACL 规则，丢弃超大分片 ICMP 数据包（例如 iptables 规则：iptables -A INPUT -p icmp -f -j DROP），并限制仅受信任的内部 IP 地址可访问设备 Web 管理界面（TCP 端口 80/443）和 Telnet/SSH 服务，同时禁用 WAN 侧 ICMP 响应以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0036.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/283999","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9655.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5292","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21637","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1072.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1072.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1072","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1072.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1072.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2002/CVE-2002-1072.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1072.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1072.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1072.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1072.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0530.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0530.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0530.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0529","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0529.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1071","title":"ZyXEL Prestige 642R 畸形TCP包导致Telnet/FTP/DHCP服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ZyXEL Prestige 642R 路由器存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标设备的 Telnet、FTP 及 DHCP 服务发送同时设置了 SYN 和 ACK 标志位的特制 TCP 数据包，触发服务崩溃导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 ZyXEL Prestige 642R 型号路由器，攻击无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。厂商已发布固件更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1071"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:40Z","remediation":"该设备已停止官方支持，建议立即更换为仍在维护周期内的新款路由器。如无法更换，可在上游防火墙或路由器上配置 ACL 规则，丢弃入站方向同时设置 SYN 和 ACK 标志位的异常 TCP 数据包；同时禁用路由器的 Telnet 和 FTP 服务（改用 SSH/SCP），并将 DHCP 服务迁移至内部专用服务器，以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/277242","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/277303","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/277307","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9372.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5034","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21561","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1071.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1071.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1071","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1071.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1071.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/551efeab39fccbe54b7908ab00ab9eb71b9e0872/2002/CVE-2002-1071.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1071.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1071.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1071.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2002-1071.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0529.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0528","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0528.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1070","title":"PHPWiki Postnuke wiki模块跨站脚本漏洞","description":"PHPWiki 1.2/1.3 的 Postnuke wiki 模块存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 pagename 参数注入恶意脚本代码，当其他用户访问被篡改的页面时脚本自动执行，导致用户会话劫持、敏感信息泄露或页面内容篡改。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，影响 PHPWiki 1.2 及 1.3 版本。Exploit-DB 已公开该漏洞的利用方法。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1070"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:40Z","remediation":"升级 PHPWiki 至 1.3.4 或更高版本（Debian 对应 phpwiki 1.3.4-1），该版本修复了 pagename 参数未正确转义导致的 XSS 漏洞。如无法升级，对所有用户输入（尤其是 pagename 参数）进行 HTML 实体编码过滤，并设置 Content-Security-Policy 响应头作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0190.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9627.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5254","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21622","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1070.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2850e862cb7837f03ec4af0066c4f9f10414e805/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1070.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1070","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1070.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1070.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2002/CVE-2002-1070.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1070.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1070.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/2cfcf35c78e88db2a4354058a5c063daa41106c3/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1070.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1070.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0528.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0527","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0527.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1060","title":"Blue Coat Systems CacheOS 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Blue Coat Systems（原 CacheFlow）CacheOS 产品存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，影响 Client Accelerator 4.1.06、Security Gateway 2.1.02 及 Server Accelerator 4.1.06 版本。远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送包含恶意 HTML 或脚本代码的 URL 请求一个不存在的域名，当设备返回错误页面时，攻击者注入的代码会在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击无需认证，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1060"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:39Z","remediation":"升级到 CacheOS 4.1.07 或更高版本（官方补丁见 http://download.cacheflow.com/release/CA/4.1.00-docs/CACacheOS41fixes.htm）。该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的 Web 缓存/代理产品。如无法升级，在反向代理或 WAF 层对 Host 头及 URL 中的特殊字符（< > \" ' &）进行 HTML 编码过滤，防止未解析域名错误页反射 XSS。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0283.html","http://download.cacheflow.com/release/CA/4.1.00-docs/CACacheOS41fixes.htm","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9674.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5305","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5608","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21649","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1060.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1060","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1060.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1060.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2002/CVE-2002-1060.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1060.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1060.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1060.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-10xx/CVE-2002-1060.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2002-1060.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0527.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0526","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0526.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1059","title":"Van Dyke SecureCRT SSH1 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Van Dyke SecureCRT SSH 客户端 3.4.6 之前版本及 4.0 beta 3 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当客户端连接至恶意 SSH 服务器时，服务器可发送超长的 SSH1 协议版本字符串触发该漏洞，导致客户端程序崩溃或执行任意代码。攻击者只需搭建恶意的 SSH 服务器并诱导用户连接即可完成利用，无需身份认证。Metasploit 框架已集成该漏洞的利用模块，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1059"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:39Z","remediation":"升级 Van Dyke SecureCRT 至 3.4.6 或 4.0 Beta 3 及以上版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。如无法升级，可禁用 SSH1 协议支持，仅使用 SSH2 连接服务器，或限制 SecureCRT 仅连接可信的 SSH 服务器以降低被攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102744150718462&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102746007908689&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9650.php","http://www.osvdb.org/4991","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5287","http://www.vandyke.com/products/securecrt/security07-25-02.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16460","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1059.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1059","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1059.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1059.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1059.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2002/CVE-2002-1059.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1059.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/7b0091a6728c321d97febad01bf502be7a113020/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b